lor-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Salvation_of_Korthos\" title=\"The Salvation of Korthos\">The Salvation of Korthos</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Arcane_Mind\" title=\"Named item sets\">Arcane Mind</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Arcane_Mind\" title=\"Named item sets\">Arcane Mind</a>:</b> +24 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to your Universal <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span>\n<ul><li>(Note: This set description is incorrect. It gives 24 <a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency</a>, not 24 <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>)</li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +1</a></b>: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Intelligence.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"> Charisma +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"> Charisma +1</a></b>: This item makes the wearer have more flair, granting a +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Charisma.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Arcane_Necklace.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Arcane_Necklace.png/420px-Arcane_Necklace.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"306\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Arcane_Necklace.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This necklace is infused with the spirit of a clever archmage.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>The other half of this set is the <a href=\"/page/Arcane_Goggles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arcane Goggles\">Arcane Goggles</a> from <a href=\"/page/Sacrifices\" title=\"Sacrifices\">Sacrifices</a>. This necklace can also be gained as an and reward from <a href=\"/page/Phiarlan_Carnival\" title=\"Phiarlan Carnival\">Phiarlan Carnival</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817033921\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.144 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4165/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23706/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6880/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n108.01%  137.325     51 Template:IO\n100.00%  127.136      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  127.136      1 -total\n 98.02%  124.614      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 38.08%   48.407      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.28%   46.128      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 34.63%   44.033      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 33.52%   42.615      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.39%   27.200      5 Template:Popup\n 16.32%   20.747      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:9737-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817033921 and revision id 628288. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
